[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a></p><p>1. Remove the cover.</p><p>2. Withdraw the retaining clip.</p><p>3. Unscrew the bolt.</p><p>4. Remove the inner guard.</p><p>5. Recover the shaped washer.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019364.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the guard is undamaged.</p><p>Fit the washer.</p><p>Position the inner trim.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p>Fit the retaining spring.</p><p>Fit the cover.</p>"],[32,127,8192,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and keep the spacer (1b) positioned inside\nthe guard.</p><p>3. Remove the inner guard.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019365.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[32,127,8192,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the inner guard is not damaged.</p><p>Position the spacer and fasten the guard\nusing the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a></p>"]]